    {
        "content": "<p>alexcrichton <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/13963#issuecomment-5075283840\">commented</a> on <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/13963\">issue #13963</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I'd expect that component to expand to <code>(component (import \"f\" (func $f)))</code> which I thought was valid, but which part are you expecting to be invalid?</p>\n</blockquote>",
        "id": 612678430,
        "sender_full_name": "Wasmtime GitHub notifications bot",
        "timestamp": 1784933859
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>lukewagner <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/13963#issuecomment-5086156683\">commented</a> on <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/13963\">issue #13963</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Yes, agreed that component should be valid, but then I think the overall WAST test should fail (b/c it says <code>assert_malformed</code>), and atm it seems to silently succeed.</p>\n</blockquote>",
        "id": 612870498,
        "sender_full_name": "Wasmtime GitHub notifications bot",
        "timestamp": 1785112195
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>alexcrichton <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/13963#issuecomment-5096743270\">commented</a> on <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/13963\">issue #13963</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Ah, yes! Should be fixed in <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14001\">https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14001</a></p>\n<p>FWIW <code>assert_malformed</code> vs <code>assert_invalid</code> are more principled in the wasm-tools crate itself, right now in Wasmtime the two aren't separated out. In that sense component-model tests might want to run both <code>wasm-tools wast</code> and <code>wasmtime wast</code>. Not a great situation per-se though and we should probably just bring <code>wasmtime wast</code> up-to-par with <code>wasm-tools wast</code></p>\n</blockquote>",
        "id": 613070082,
        "sender_full_name": "Wasmtime GitHub notifications bot",
        "timestamp": 1785185850
    },
