        "content": "<p>alexcrichton closed <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/13963\">issue #13963</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>For example, this WAST test succeeds when I think it should fail:</p>\n<p><div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"WebAssembly\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">assert_malformed</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">component</span> <span class=\"err\">quote</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">\"(import </span><span class=\"se\">\\\"</span><span class=\"s2\">f</span><span class=\"se\">\\\"</span><span class=\"s2\"> (func $f))\"</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">)</span>\n  <span class=\"s2\">\"nothing wrong\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div><br>\n</p>\n</blockquote>",
